  "description": "Proposed extension to the existing Eruv in Mill Hill comprising of works at the following 3no. sites along The Ridgeway (Locations 14, 15 and 16).\r\r- Location 14, Belmont Farm access gates and Sheepwash Pond - Installation of polycarbonate sheet to each gate post; Installation of timber post and wire fence.\r- Location 15, Sheepwash Pond - Installation of one (1) pair of poles each 5.5m high with connecting wire; Extension and rewiring of the existing timber post and wire fence.\r- Location 16, Footpath between St Paul's C of E Primary School and The Bungalow - Installation of a 2.7m high tubular arch and a 1.05m high timber post and wire fence.\r- Removal of existing poles at the following locations - 1no adjacent to Belmont Farm; 1no. north of war memorial; 1no. to the right hand side of Mill Hill School vehicular access and 1no. directly opposite.\r",
